                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.24/954: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-04-08T14:00:00-04:00">April 8, 1943—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6:01 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>662. Department’s No. 403, April 6, 7 p.m. Embassy continues to urge importance
                    of this matter upon Chilean authorities several times daily. It is expected that
                    importable list will be available to the public within 3 days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
